            text: "A facilitator should inform learners about potentially distressing content before a session. Participation in scenarios and reflections must be optional. Never ask for personal testimonies or facilitate public identification of survivors. Provide private, verified information about support channels; explain the limits of privacy and mandatory reporting. Train facilitators to respond calmly to unexpected disclosures and to refer rather than investigate.",
