            text: "Key messages. GBV has many interrelated forms. Visible injury is not required for harm to be serious. Consent and personal autonomy matter. A survivor deserves non-judgmental support whether or not they report an incident. Safe professional assistance can include health, protection, psychosocial and justice services, depending on needs and wishes.",
